    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμψηφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>voting with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				500a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>La.</u>
				184d
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινί τινος</span>
			<i>voting with</i> one <i>for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				380c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cra.</u>
				398c
			</span></i>: c. dat. rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῷ ἐπαίνῳ, τοῖς
				λόγοις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				811e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				907b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λόγος . . ς. ὤν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πάθεσιν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i><i>M M</i><i><span class="en">
				1206b25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1203b27
			</span></i>: abs., <i>voting together, of the same opinion</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβεῖν τινα ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				929b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				16.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sto. Herc.</u>
				339.16
			</span></i>. </div>
